        <tr> 
          <td bgcolor="black" class="text"> 
            <img src="http://www.colourtec.com/lee/kael-melee.jpg" border="0"><br>
<br>
<b>TATATATATATTTATTATTATAT!!!!!<br>
<br>
Guys, you all ROCK - Kael last night, while a bit stingy on loot, was a BLAST...  I was so happy to see so many out & helping develop the teamwork we need to take on bigger things.  <br>
<br>
To be honest, I wasn't sure how well we would fare - but now we're trying to find the 'next level' of targets we should go after, since apparently Kael is a cakewalk for us.  I really like Abby's idea of heading in past the Icewall in the arena, deeper towards the Temple of Rallos Zek in Kael, and think that next time we go there we should definitely push in further!<br>
<br>
My only regret in the night is that we didn't start alternating positions earlier (I really liked having some other people tank and get a feel for raid tanking / off tanking, and would like to do more of it in the future so we aren't so dependant on 2 or 3 people to do anything significant).<br>
<br>
Inertia has all the attendance & loots & everything and will post the details of the night, so I got to spend my morning taking art lessons from that Gobbo artist who provided coverage of the Plasmatic priest battles - its just some of the Melees at the moment, plus our UberTank Abrethel... But I hope to add some more to it soon =D<br>
<br>
Finally - I'd love to hear some feedback from you all - what you liked, what you didn't like, what you feel we need to improve on... I can think of a few things, but I want to hear your thoughts first.<br>
<br>
Also, of course, I'd love to hear where *you* want to raid next, that you feel is within our reach.<br>
<br>
TATATATTTATATATTATATATATATAAA!!!!!<br>
<br>
- Drachon Ar'Kanis<br>
Revenant of the BLOODHORDE<br>
<br>

